  "bio": "Amanda West is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in the illustrative style, bringing each design to life with remarkable precision and creativity. Her dedication to maintaining a clean and hygienic workspace ensures that every client's experience is not only artistically fulfilling but also conducted under the highest standards of cleanliness. With a welcoming demeanor, she creates a comfortable environment where clients can enjoy the transformation of their ideas into stunning body art.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nTattoo artist, cyclist, runner & weight lifting, Mum of 2 legends.\nEmail amandawesttattoos@outlook.com for tattoo enquiries. www.AmandaWesttattoos.com",
